Tests for additional functionality to support z/OS authorized mode (where print
functions are not allowed).

run_func_ptrs - script to run test_func_ptrs.c.  Calls function pointers for
print functions with default settings and then with non-default user-supplied
print functions.  After running, also check file foo which contains fprintf
and vfprintf output.

run_error_print - script to run test_error_print.c.  Calls BLAS functions that
print error messages with invalid arguments so as to trigger printing.  Calls
each such function first with default print functions, and then with
user-supplied ones.
